            "old": "Candidate full-cue source plan for ElevenLabs Oliver, combined-repair-stage07/candidate, script b89eab60: 80 units, one per cue, at most 100 words. 01_5's wording changed, so no take of its old text can bind. It says nothing about whether a recording of any other cue exists; unchanged wording is not evidence of a usable take. No synthesis, take selection, listening, timing or independent acceptance. No Michael or FrankenTTS.",
